<title>USA: Hutchinson Technology Q1 Dec 29 net rises.</title>
<headline>Hutchinson Technology Q1 Dec 29 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>HUTCHINSON, Minn. 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>HUTCHINSON TECHNOLOGY INC</p>
<p>  First Quarter Ended	 Dec. 29, 1996	 Dec. 24, 1995</p>
<p> Net sales			     $106,906		 $83,332</p>
<p> Cost of sales			   75,794		  61,888</p>
<p> Gross profit			    31,112		  21,444</p>
<p> Income from operations		14,455		   3,828</p>
<p> Income before income taxes	  13,903		   3,669</p>
<p> Net income				11,117		   2,862</p>
<p> Net income per share		    1.97		    0.51</p>
<p> Weighted avg shrs			5,629		   5,623</p>
<p>				 At Dec. 29, 1996    At Sep. 29, 1996</p>
<p> Total Assets			  $289,532		$238,983</p>
<p> Cash and cash equivalents	   54,482		  22,884</p>
<p> Total shareholders' investment   145,037		 133,684</p>
<p>		     (In thousands, except per share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: Fiscal 1996 first quarter results included a $0.69 per share charge against earnings reflecting recognition of fixed commitments to IBM under a technology sharing agreement.</p>
<p>Gross margin in the quarter was 29 percent compared to 26 percent in the fiscal 1996 first quarter and 20 percent in the preceding quarter.</p>
</text>
